      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report four ankylosing spondylitis cases observed within 11 years (1990-2000) of rheumatologic exercise among 10,000 patients examined in consultation and hospitalization at Brazzaville university teaching hospital. It confirms that ankylosing spondylitis is a rare disease in sub-Saharan black Africa."},
